      "message": "\u003e In any case, Graphite seems to run fine both with Std140 and Std430 SSBOs - maybe because we don\u0027t have any cases where we pass arrays as function parameters?\n\nGradient code actually passes arrays fairly often. e.g.\n\n`$pure half4 $colorize_grad_4(float4 colorsParam[4], float4 offsetsParam, float2 t) {`",
      "parentUuid": "8780efff_a924b684",
      "revId": "4db67054ca80a686c9084c49c84af8212e6e8234",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
